  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Elections Meaningful: Promoting Electoral J</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen policy-based voting during the elections, promote effective administration of electoral justice and strengthen the participation of women and youths in the electoral processes.  The project has three specific outputs: (1) a broad-based Citizens&#x2019; Manifesto for the 2023 elections developed and disseminated (2) improved electoral justice administration during the elections cycle (3) increased participation of women and youths with the electoral processes as candidates and voters</narrative>
  </description>
